po"><addressbook><name>OOHASHI TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA, CHIKARA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OOHASHI, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A photosensitive resin composition which comprises: (A) a carboxylated binder polymer containing comonomer units derived from styrene or a derivative thereof, (B) a photopolymerization initiator, and (C) at least one photopolymerizable compound which has at least one polymerizable, ethylenically unsaturated bond per molecule and comprises as an essential component a compound represented by general formula (I) (wherein R&lt;1&gt; represents hydrogen or methyl; A represents alkyleneoxy; Z&lt;1&gt; represents halogeno, alkyl, cycloalkyl, aryl, amino, alkylamino, dialkylamino, nitro, cyano, mercapto, alkylmercapto, allyl, hydroxyalkyl, carboxyalkyl, acyl, alkoxy, or a group containing a heterocycle; m is an integer of 4 to 20; and n is an integer of 0 to 5).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une composition de résine photosensible, qui comprend A) un polymère liant carboxylé contenant des unités de comonomères dérivés de styrène ou d'un dérivé de ce dernier, B) un amorceur de photopolymérisation et C) au moins un composé photopolymérisable possédant par molécule au moins une liaison polymérisable non saturée en éthylène et, comme composant essentiel, un composé représenté par la formule générale (I), dans laquelle R&lt;1&gt; réprésente un hydrogène ou un méthyle, A représente un alkylèneoxy, Z&lt;1&gt; représente halogéno, un alkyle, un cycloalkyle, un aryle, amino, alkylamino, dialkylamino, nitro, cyano, mercapto, alkylmercapto, un allyle, un hydroxyalkyle, un carboaxyle, un acyle, un alkoxy ou un groupe contenant un hétérocycle, m est un nombre entier compris entre 4 et 20, et n est un nombre entier compris entre 0 et 5.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>